/// Canonical camelCase YAML sub-key the `:upgrade-from :instructions`
/// per-entry OTP-appup-shaped typed [`crate::UpgradeInstruction`] list
/// axis lands under inside each element of the [`M2_KEY_UPGRADE_FROM`]
