/// Canonical human-readable label the M3 [`crate::CaixaKind::Aplicacao`]
/// arm surfaces under [`crate::CaixaKind::as_str`] and (routed through
/// it) [`std::fmt::Display`]. Peer of [`CAIXA_KIND_LABEL_BIBLIOTECA`] /
