///     `spec.rules[].matches[].path` axis (caixa-mesh/src/lib.rs — the
///     `gateway_routes` per-Aplicacao `HTTPRoute`'s per-match
///     `match_entry.insert("path", …)` call seeded from the Aplicacao's
///     `:entrada :paths` slot).
