/// Structural peer to sibling [`kube_name`] (c9cdecb) / [`kube_namespace`]
/// (e18297b) on the two sub-`metadata.*` coordinates: [`kube_name`]
/// closes the accessor arity on the identity axis; [`kube_namespace`]
